{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794535893000,"sessionID":"ses_e2d54b823ffefnuiBU4DScqTFL","part":{"partID":"prt_1d2aca033002KBUw8cPGOnQh8v","sessionID":"ses_e2d54b823ffefnuiBU4DScqTFL","messageID":"msg_1d2ac6335001DwfOCMusPz35Wy","type":"tool","id":"call_338f54c980da42788cf815f9","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/README.md","oldString":"| `check-prompt-quality-card-sync.sh` | Checks prompt quality-card sync state. |\n| `verify-zombie-soak.sh` | Runs zombie process soak verification. |","newString":"| `check-prompt-quality-card-sync.sh` | Checks prompt quality-card sync state. |\n| `measure-embedder-cost.mjs` | Prints one JSON object with the embedder's cost. It reads `/api/version`, `/api/tags` and `/api/ps` at `OLLAMA_BASE_URL` or `http://127.0.0.1:11434`, the `ollama serve` and model runner rows of `ps -axo`, 30 query embeddings and five end-to-end `advisor_recommend` calls. It writes, starts and unloads nothing, so the loaded model leaves on Ollama's own idle timer. Exits 2 when `/api/version` does not answer, naming the URL it tried. |\n| `verify-zombie-soak.sh` | Runs zombie process soak verification. |"},"output":"Edited .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/README.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/README.md","patch":"Index: .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/README.md\n===================================================================\n--- .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/README.md\n+++ .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/README.md\n@@ -58,8 +58,9 @@\n | `command-bridges/` | Holds authored bridge inputs, compatibility evidence and the generated command-bridge projection. |\n | `check-skill-doc-frontmatter.mjs` | Checks skill document frontmatter coverage. |\n | `check-skill-doc-frontmatter.sh` | Shell wrapper for skill document frontmatter checks. |\n | `check-prompt-quality-card-sync.sh` | Checks prompt quality-card sync state. |\n+| `measure-embedder-cost.mjs` | Prints one JSON object with the embedder's cost. It reads `/api/version`, `/api/tags` and `/api/ps` at `OLLAMA_BASE_URL` or `http://127.0.0.1:11434`, the `ollama serve` and model runner rows of `ps -axo`, 30 query embeddings and five end-to-end `advisor_recommend` calls. It writes, starts and unloads nothing, so the loaded model leaves on Ollama's own idle timer. Exits 2 when `/api/version` does not answer, naming the URL it tried. |\n | `verify-zombie-soak.sh` | Runs zombie process soak verification. |\n | `skill-graph.json` | Diagnostic JSON export for inspection; runtime routing consumes SQLite instead. |\n \n ---\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":0}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/README.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/README.md\",\"oldString\":\"| `check-prompt-quality-card-sync.sh` | Checks prompt quality-card sync state. |\\n| `verify-zombie-soak.sh` | Runs zombie process soak verification. |\",\"newString\":\"| `check-prompt-quality-card-sync.sh` | Checks prompt quality-card sync state. |\\n| `measure-embedder-cost.mjs` | Prints one JSON object with the embedder's cost. It reads `/api/version`, `/api/tags` and `/api/ps` at `OLLAMA_BASE_URL` or `http://127.0.0.1:11434`, the `ollama serve` and model runner rows of `ps -axo`, 30 query embeddings and five end-to-end `advisor_recommend` calls. It writes, starts and unloads nothing, so the loaded model leaves on Ollama's own idle timer. Exits 2 when `/api/version` does not answer, naming the URL it tried. |\\n| `verify-zombie-soak.sh` | Runs zombie process soak verification. |\"}"},"time":{"start":1794535890995,"end":1794535893000}}}}
