{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794535899655,"sessionID":"ses_e2d54b823ffefnuiBU4DScqTFL","part":{"partID":"prt_1d2acbfee0020EAbDm33BIDVDW","sessionID":"ses_e2d54b823ffefnuiBU4DScqTFL","messageID":"msg_1d2acb545001sCZd3HrLtJZWwJ","type":"tool","id":"call_e39108108d2e4133aeed9635","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"| `skill-graph.json` | Diagnostic JSON export for inspection; runtime routing consumes SQLite instead. |\n\nFor a cold sample, leave the model unloaded: wait until `curl -s localhost:11434/api/ps | jq '.models | length'` prints `0`, then run the script. The first embedding then pays the load and is reported as `cold.firstCallMs`, with the idle `ollama serve` memory as `idle.serveRssKb`.","oldString":"| `skill-graph.json` | Diagnostic JSON export for inspection; runtime routing consumes SQLite instead. |","path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/README.md"},"output":"Edited .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/README.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/README.md","patch":"Index: .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/README.md\n===================================================================\n--- .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/README.md\n+++ .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/README.md\n@@ -62,8 +62,10 @@\n | `measure-embedder-cost.mjs` | Prints one JSON object with the embedder's cost. It reads `/api/version`, `/api/tags` and `/api/ps` at `OLLAMA_BASE_URL` or `http://127.0.0.1:11434`, the `ollama serve` and model runner rows of `ps -axo`, 30 query embeddings and five end-to-end `advisor_recommend` calls. It writes, starts and unloads nothing, so the loaded model leaves on Ollama's own idle timer. Exits 2 when `/api/version` does not answer, naming the URL it tried. |\n | `verify-zombie-soak.sh` | Runs zombie process soak verification. |\n | `skill-graph.json` | Diagnostic JSON export for inspection; runtime routing consumes SQLite instead. |\n \n+For a cold sample, leave the model unloaded: wait until `curl -s localhost:11434/api/ps | jq '.models | length'` prints `0`, then run the script. The first embedding then pays the load and is reported as `cold.firstCallMs`, with the idle `ollama serve` memory as `idle.serveRssKb`.\n+\n ---\n \n ## 4. BOUNDARIES AND FLOW\n \n","status":"modified","additions":2,"deletions":0}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/README.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\":\"| `skill-graph.json` | Diagnostic JSON export for inspection; runtime routing consumes SQLite instead. |\\n\\nFor a cold sample, leave the model unloaded: wait until `curl -s localhost:11434/api/ps | jq '.models | length'` prints `0`, then run the script. The first embedding then pays the load and is reported as `cold.firstCallMs`, with the idle `ollama serve` memory as `idle.serveRssKb`.\",\"oldString\":\"| `skill-graph.json` | Diagnostic JSON export for inspection; runtime routing consumes SQLite instead. |\",\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/README.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794535899118,"end":1794535899655}}}}
