{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794535904910,"sessionID":"ses_e2d54b823ffefnuiBU4DScqTFL","part":{"partID":"prt_1d2acd5830015R6exOvaA3DRaz","sessionID":"ses_e2d54b823ffefnuiBU4DScqTFL","messageID":"msg_1d2acc9d9001uFnDjKnn4KaOmb","type":"tool","id":"call_7405a80081544f9a8f6b64a3","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"rg -n \"measure-embedder-cost\" .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/README.md; echo \"exit=$?\"","workdir":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research"},"output":"62:| `measure-embedder-cost.mjs` | Prints one JSON object with the embedder's cost. It reads `/api/version`, `/api/tags` and `/api/ps` at `OLLAMA_BASE_URL` or `http://127.0.0.1:11434`, the `ollama serve` and model runner rows of `ps -axo`, 30 query embeddings and five end-to-end `advisor_recommend` calls. It writes, starts and unloads nothing, so the loaded model leaves on Ollama's own idle timer. Exits 2 when `/api/version` does not answer, naming the URL it tried. |\nexit=0\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"62:| `measure-embedder-cost.mjs` | Prints one JSON object with the embedder's cost. It reads `/api/version`, `/api/tags` and `/api/ps` at `OLLAMA_BASE_URL` or `http://127.0.0.1:11434`, the `ollama serve` and model runner rows of `ps -axo`, 30 query embeddings and five end-to-end `advisor_recommend` calls. It writes, starts and unloads nothing, so the loaded model leaves on Ollama's own idle timer. Exits 2 when `/api/version` does not answer, naming the URL it tried. |\nexit=0\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"rg -n \\\"measure-embedder-cost\\\" .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/README.md; echo \\\"exit=$?\\\"\",\"workdir\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research\"}"},"time":{"start":1794535904643,"end":179