l -s localhost:11434/api/ps | jq '.models | length'` prints `0`, then run the script. The first embedding then pays the load and is reported as `cold.firstCallMs`, with the idle `ollama serve` memory as `idle.serveRssKb`.\n+\n ---\n \n ## 4. BOUNDARIES AND FLOW\n---STATUS---\n M .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/README.md\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"diff --git a/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/README.md b/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/README.md\nindex 02d74af3fe..7cfaa99a6a 100644\n--- a/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/README.md\n+++ b/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/README.md\n@@ -59,9 +59,12 @@ scripts/\n | `check-skill-doc-frontmatter.mjs` | Checks skill document frontmatter coverage. |\n | `check-skill-doc-frontmatter.sh` | Shell wrapper for skill document frontmatter checks. |\n | `check-prompt-quality-card-sync.sh` | Checks prompt quality-card sync state. |\n+| `measure-embedder-cost.mjs` | Prints one JSON object with the embedder's cost. It reads `/api/version`, `/api/tags` and `/api/ps` at `OLLAMA_BASE_URL` or `http://127.0.0.1:11434`, the `ollama serve` and model runner rows of `ps -axo`, 30 query embeddings and five end-to-end `advisor_recommend` calls. It writes, starts and unloads nothing, so the loaded model leaves on Ollama's own idle timer. Exits 2 when `/api/version` does not answer, naming the URL it tried. |\n | `verify-zombie-soak.sh` | Runs zombie process soak verification. |\n | `skill-graph.json` | Diagnostic JSON export for inspection; runtime routing consumes SQLite instead. |\n \n+For a cold sample, leave the model unloaded: wait until `curl -s localhost:11434/api/ps | jq '.models | length'` prints `0`, then run the script. The first embedding then pays the load and is reported as `cold.firstCallMs`, with the idle `ollama serve` memory as `idle.serveRssKb`.\n+\n ---\n \n ## 4. BOUNDARIES AND FLOW\n---STATUS---\n M .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/README.md\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"git -c core.fsmonitor=false diff -- .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/README.md; echo \\\"---STATUS---\\\"; git -c core.fsmonitor=false status --short -- .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/README.md\",\"workdir\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research\"}"},"time":{"start":1794535910326,"end":1794535911112}}}}
