{"type":"text","timestamp":1794535918408,"sessionID":"ses_e2d54b823ffefnuiBU4DScqTFL","part":{"id":"prt_1d2ad0155001jxIO3ls1XnjTnI","sessionID":"ses_e2d54b823ffefnuiBU4DScqTFL","messageID":"msg_1d2acf4d90015j4DodPb7nOnGO","type":"text","text":"Done. T030 is in place in `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/README.md`.\n\nThe change adds one table entry under §3 KEY FILES for `measure-embedder-cost.mjs` covering what the script reads, that it writes and unloads nothing, and its exit 2, plus one sentence after the table on taking a cold sample. No other file was touched, and the task checkbox was left unticked.\n\nVerify output (`rg -n \"measure-embedder-cost\" $ADV/scripts/README.md`):\n\n```\n62:| `measure-embedder-cost.mjs` | Prints one JSON object with the embedder's cost. It reads `/api/version`, `/api/tags` and `/api/ps` at `OLLAMA_BASE_URL` or `http://127.0.0.1:11434`, the `ollama serve` and model runner rows of `ps -axo`, 30 query embeddings and five end-to-end `advisor_recommend` calls. It writes, starts and unloads nothing, so the loaded model leaves on Ollama's own idle timer. Exits 2 when `/api/version` does not answer, naming the URL it tried. |\nexit=0\n```\n\nI also ran the README's own §6 validator as a secondary check: `python3 .skilled/skills/sk-doc/scripts/validate_document.py .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/README.md` printed `✅ VALID` with 0 issues, exit 0.\n\nNothing was left undone.","time":{"start":1794535915861,"end":1794535918408}}}
